[{"id":"b130581","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"16be71f","elType":"widget","settings":{"shortcode":"[elementor-template id=3639]"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"shortcode"},{"id":"02e1278","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='et et-hero et-hero-s'><picture><source media='(max-width:700px)' srcset='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-gabriel-garcia-1263144-2404046-600x810.jpg'><img src='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-gabriel-garcia-1263144-2404046-1536x1024.jpg' alt='' fetchpriority='high' decoding='async' data-o='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-gabriel-garcia-1263144-2404046-scaled.jpg' onerror=etF(this)></picture><span class='et-arch-o'></span><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-crumb'><a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/'>Home</a> / <a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/destination/'>Tours</a> / Authentic Morocco Tour</div><span class='et-eye'>Grand tour · 11 days</span><h1>Authentic Morocco Tour</h1><p class='lead'>Experience the magic of Morocco through imperial cities, Atlas Mountains, and Sahara dunes. From Casablanca to Marrakech, every day unveils a new story.</p><div class='et-ctas'><a class='et-btn' href='#et-iti'>See the day-by-day plan <svg aria-hidden='true' width='16' height='16'><use href='#et-i-arrow'/></svg></a><a class='et-btn et-btn-w et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596?text=Hello%20Epic%20Travel%20Morocco,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Authentic%20Morocco%20Tour%20(11%20days).%20' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-wa'/></svg>Book on WhatsApp</a></div></div></section><div class='et'><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-facts'><div><b>11 days</b><span>10 nights</span></div><div><b>Casablanca</b><span>starting point</span></div><div><b>Casablanca</b><span>end of the tour</span></div><div><b>Private</b><span>your own driver &amp; vehicle</span></div></div></div></div><section class='et et-sec' id='et-iti'><div class='et-wrap et-tour'><div><h3 style='font-size:20px'>Route</h3><div class='et-stops'><span>Casablanca</span><span>Rabat</span><span>Fes</span><span>Volubilis</span><span>Meknes</span><span>Merzouga</span><span>Todra Gorge</span><span>Dades</span><span>Ait Benhaddou</span><span>Marrakech</span></div><div class='et-iti-h'><div><span class='et-eye'>Itinerary</span><h2>Day by day</h2></div><button type='button' class='et-tog' data-o='0'>Open all days</button></div><div class='et-iti'><details class='et-day et-rv' open><summary><span class='et-node'>1</span><small>Day 1</small><b>Casablanca</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>The excitement of your personalized tour begins when you first start planning your trip, even before you land in the Casablanca airport. Your English-speaking driver will meet you at the airport. If time permits, visit Hassan II Mosque, one of the largest mosques in the world. Guided tour available, with views of the Atlantic Ocean through glass flooring sections.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>2</span><small>Day 2</small><b>Rabat · Fes</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Drive to Fes with a stop in Rabat. Explore the capital, Oudaïa Kasbah, Bab Oudaïa gate, Musée de Oudaïa, Andalusian garden, then continue to Fes. Enjoy Moroccan breakfast and lunch along the way.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>3</span><small>Day 3</small><b>Explore Fes</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Spend the day exploring Fes medina. Visit tanneries, King’s Palace, pottery markets, and taste local dishes. Guided tour explains cultural and historical details.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>4</span><small>Day 4</small><b>Volubilis · Meknes · Fes</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Visit Roman ruins of Volubilis, then the holy town of Moulay Idris. Afternoon tour to Meknes, UNESCO World Heritage site. Return to Fes for dinner and overnight.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>5</span><small>Day 5</small><b>Fes · Merzouga</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Travel across Middle Atlas Mountains through forests, rock faces, and Berber villages, descending into the Sahara Desert. Overnight at riad/hotel in Merzouga.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>6</span><small>Day 6</small><b>Explore Sahara style life</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Afternoon four-wheel drive across Sahara dunes. Optional camel ride to Berber tents for overnight stay. Experience desert life and sunset views.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>7</span><small>Day 7</small><b>Toudgha Gorges · Boumalen Dades</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Sunrise on dunes, breakfast in the open desert, then camel ride back. Travel by 4×4 to Toudgha Gorges and explore towering rock walls. Overnight in Boumalen Dades.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>8</span><small>Day 8</small><b>Dades · Ait Benhaddou · Marrakech</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Drive to Marrakech via Ouarzazate. Visit Kasbah Ait Benhaddou, High Atlas Mountains, and arrive in Marrakech. Explore city highlights and enjoy local culture.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>9</span><small>Day 9</small><b>Explore the Red City of Marrakech</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Guided tour of Marrakech: Bahia Palace, Saadian tombs, and city streets. Experience the lively Jemaa El Fna square and traditional Moroccan cuisine.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>10</span><small>Day 10</small><b>Transfer to Casablanca</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Return to Casablanca. Free time for shopping and sightseeing. Last opportunity to buy souvenirs and enjoy Moroccan flavors.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>11</span><small>Day 11</small><b>Departure to the airport</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Arrive at the airport 2-3 hours before departure. End of your 11-day Authentic Morocco Tour with Epic Travel Morocco.</p></div></details></div><div class='et-note'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-info'/></svg><div><b>Tailor-made:</b> Customized tour options available upon request. Tell us your dates and we send you a detailed quote.</div></div></div><aside class='et-side'><div class='et-book'><div class='et-book-h et-dark'><h3>Book this tour</h3><p>Free quote within 24 hours — no payment to ask.</p></div><ul><li><span>Duration</span><b>11 days / 10 nights</b></li><li><span>Start</span><b>Casablanca</b></li><li><span>End</span><b>Casablanca</b></li><li><span>Style</span><b>Grand tour</b></li><li><span>Type</span><b>Private tour</b></li></ul><div class='et-book-f'><a class='et-btn et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596?text=Hello%20Epic%20Travel%20Morocco,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Authentic%20Morocco%20Tour%20(11%20days).%20' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-wa'/></svg>Book on WhatsApp</a><a class='et-btn et-btn-o' href='mailto:epictravelmorocco@gmail.com?subject=Authentic%20Morocco%20Tour'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-mail'/></svg>Email us</a><a class='et-btn' href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/contact-2/'>Send a request</a><small>WhatsApp +212 661 292 596 · Tel +1 579 484 7707</small></div></div></aside></div></section><section class='et et-sec et-pat'><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-head'><div class='et-orn